[{:db/id 17592186166816 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-967d2e95-57ac-5662-bd22-c0decd75429c" "question-615e1fed-a4a8-59b3-8748-a44e86a3ce62" "question-e8cab3f8-2d4f-5187-b7bf-4e4ac59dbfe4"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-967d2e95-57ac-5662-bd22-c0decd75429c" :question/id #uuid "967d2e95-57ac-5662-bd22-c0decd75429c" :question/math-academy-id "q-96847" :question/problem "Given $X∼\\text{Po}(2),$ compute $P(X=5),$ rounded to $4$ decimal places." :question/worked-solution "If $X∼\\text{Po}(\\lambda ),$ then $X$ has the following probability mass function:\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\frac{{\\lambda }^{x}{e}^{-\\lambda }}{x!}\n$$\n\nHere, $X∼\\text{Po}(2),$ so the distribution of $X$ in this case is\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\frac{{2}^{x}{e}^{-2}}{x!}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(X=5) & =f(5) \\\\  & =\\frac{{2}^{5}{e}^{-2}}{5!} \\\\  & ≈0.0361.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-11838f10-dc22-5f3b-ba56-0d91440185de"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-11838f10-dc22-5f3b-ba56-0d91440185de" :answer-field/id #uuid "11838f10-dc22-5f3b-ba56-0d91440185de" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-78b3c30e-bbe9-50c9-a378-76cb62a0a57a" :answer-field/choices ["answer-78b3c30e-bbe9-50c9-a378-76cb62a0a57a" "answer-92fa4d3d-3196-543c-b2e9-3de9e87a5486" "answer-4266e4f5-01a4-59c0-9d1a-6a59858398c5" "answer-8d665c00-37aa-5b15-bca3-222341cd0fb8" "answer-d62cc53f-5c2d-54bf-8c03-97c83dc95c5b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-78b3c30e-bbe9-50c9-a378-76cb62a0a57a" :answer/id #uuid "78b3c30e-bbe9-50c9-a378-76cb62a0a57a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.0361" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-92fa4d3d-3196-543c-b2e9-3de9e87a5486" :answer/id #uuid "92fa4d3d-3196-543c-b2e9-3de9e87a5486" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.0802" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4266e4f5-01a4-59c0-9d1a-6a59858398c